<title>INDIA: India's SmithKline Beecham board meets on Dec 16.</title>
<headline>India's SmithKline Beecham board meets on Dec 16.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SmithKline Beecham Consumers Health Ltd will hold a board meeting on December 16 to consider second interim dividend, the company said on Monday in a statement to the Bombay Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company is a major health drinks manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
